<title>Iraq: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iraq/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iraq-2026-11-25T08:56:13.968Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 08:56:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Iraqi prime minister ordered the ministry to take direct control of oilfields held by Kurdish parties, prompting the KDP and PUK to unite in opposition and warn Baghdad against unilateral decisions. Security forces dismissed the border crossings chief and a border official, installed new commanders in Kirkuk, and seized trucks in a fuel-smuggling operation. Iraqi security also seized two drone launchers in Maysan and reported a drone hit an Azadi camp minutes after a missile strike. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQT0ttY1ZZa0d3ajhmMUVZYmhrdHNGd0E4aC0wQWswZzc0UkFrcndsZ3pJUkJQMVF3Rlp0cjdGdkc2bG5XY093OWx6QWdtQVlJMVpRN2QzUUZicGRBZEROT2JUZEdQUTRpWHBpYzNXMVVwN1FQbmZpVmZfTm1leHQzclpZSkdsRk9MWHBzZEpaSlFoVjd0QzZQMnl2SDladHhlTzFmYkhmT2xPSlRTc2o2VmY2ZThoQ0dxbl94NXAxaXFWTHBNb1V6bzhXRTFPQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxNdFQtVTRNaHQ0VDNsenhqUndQQmNLaDFyMF9uTjhrNXZTY0RUUnVERVJ5SGlRRnlMNlpVclJQb3hjSGZtNTY5RjE3UTlQZnJvUmRyTDU4Nm5rNHVaSTREUmt2Vmd6N21BNEstSENvUWQ0YmdzTFhGS0I1RFFwTWR2VDRUb0I?oc=5&quot;&gt;Financial Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.crisisgroup.org/qna/asia-pacific/myanmar/world-court-finds-myanmar-committed-genocide-against-rohingya&quot;&gt;International Crisis Group&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxObkFfQVhSMjZVSnFfRkZwclpmdkdwUEhtTU5jU2VJb0MzWVFuX1BpNGdaa0duRmFSNzNrcTVpcU9qM1FlWnVvdkk2MVZoNGJrR2FNQlVYT2gzcHlsS1lKOUNXTUNFUTdtWkwtbGY4b25rMDNKOGMxX2ZoNzVUMmRvbXZkaGVRODBPMWQ0UFhaNGdTbVhiYlF4Nm84akE1c1NON2hxZndWR2ZZa1U4azUxTHIzWjQ3NzVmX2pIb0M1WEZ6N00xWEdROFZMWHZuZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء ال